# ARMENU — CURSOR QOIDALARI

> Bu fayl har yangi chatda avtomatik yuklanadi.
> Sen — bu loyihaning **kod yozuvchisisan**. Arxitektura va tahlil boshqa AI tomonidan qilingan.

---

## 🎯 SENING ROLING

| Sen QILASAN | Sen QILMAYSAN |
|---|---|
| ✅ Roadmap'dagi vazifalarni kod bilan bajarasan | ❌ Arxitekturani o'zgartirmaysan |
| ✅ Test yozasan va ishga tushirasan | ❌ Yangi funksiya o'ylab topmaysan |
| ✅ Handoff faylni to'ldirasan | ❌ Vazifa tartibini buzmaysan |
| ✅ Xato bo'lsa tuzatasan | ❌ TZ dan chetga chiqmaysan |

**Muammo yoki noaniqlik chiqsa** → handoff faylga yozasan, o'zing hal qilmaysan.

---

## 🚀 ISHNI BOSHLASH

Har yangi chatda birinchi ish:

```bash
cat ROADMAP/START.md
python3 ROADMAP/03_HOLAT/update_progress.py --status
```

Keyin `PROGRESS.md` ko'rsatgan fazadan davom et.

---

## ⛔ 12 TA QAT'IY TAQIQ

| # | Taqiq | Nima uchun |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | ⛔ `mebelcity_platform` papkasiga **TEGMA** | Alohida loyiha. Sening ish joying: `/home/user/armenu/` |
| 2 | ⛔ Port `8040`, `8041` **ISHLATMA** | Band. Seniki: `8060`, `8061` |
| 3 | ⛔ Redis `db=0..4` **ISHLATMA** | Band. Seniki: `db=5`, `db=6` |
| 4 | ⛔ `bittada-*` servislarga **TEGMA** | Seniki: `armenu-*` |
| 5 | ⛔ **`# TODO`, `# FIXME`, `...`, "shu yerga yozing" YOZMA** | Kod to'liq bo'lishi shart |
| 6 | ⛔ **Vazifa tartibini buzma** | V-043 dan oldin V-042 |
| 7 | ⛔ **Test o'tmasa keyingi vazifaga o'tma** | Sifat |
| 8 | ⛔ **`TZ_MASTER/` ni to'liq o'qima** | 260 KB. Faqat `grep` bilan kerakli qismini |
| 9 | ⛔ **Narxni frontenddan olma** | Har doim serverda hisobla |
| 10 | ⛔ **Hard-code rang yozma** | Faqat `var(--bg)`, `var(--text)` |
| 11 | ⛔ **Hard-code matn yozma** | Faqat `t('kalit')` yoki `{% trans %}` |
| 12 | ⛔ **Uzoq ishni web so'rovda qilma** | `enqueue(...)` → worker |

---

## ✅ 10 TA MAJBURIY QOIDA

| # | Qoida | Kod |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Har tenant modeli `restaurant` FK bilan | `class X(TenantModel)` |
| 2 | Har ViewSet tenant-scoped | `class XViewSet(TenantScopedMixin, ModelViewSet)` |
| 3 | Miqdor butun son | `Math.ceil()` / `math.ceil()` |
| 4 | 3 til: uz, ru, en | `name_uz`, `name_ru`, `name_en` |
| 5 | Dark + Light | `var(--bg-card)` |
| 6 | Idempotency (POST) | `X-Idempotency-Key` |
| 7 | WS guruh restoran-scoped | `rest_<id>_kds` |
| 8 | Tashqi API → circuit breaker | `breaker.call(fn, fallback=...)` |
| 9 | N+1 yo'q | `select_related` / `prefetch_related` |
| 10 | Post-commit hook | `transaction.on_commit(lambda: ...)` |

---

## 🔁 ISH SIKLI (har vazifa uchun)

```
1. Vazifani o'qi:
   grep -A 60 "## V-043" ROADMAP/01_FAZALAR/FAZA_02_MENYU.md

2. Kodni yoz (fayl yo'li va kod vazifada berilgan)

3. Test:
   pytest tests/ -x -q
   ❌ → tuzat, 2-qadamga qayt
   ✅ → 4-qadam

4. Commit + progress:
   git add -A && git commit -m "V-043: menyu API keshi"
   python3 ROADMAP/03_HOLAT/update_progress.py V-043 ok

5. Keyingi vazifaga o't (1-qadam)
```

**Faza tugagach** → `HANDOFF/FAZA_XX_HANDOFF.md` ni to'ldir (shablon: `HANDOFF/HANDOFF_TEMPLATE.md`).

---

## 🔍 SAVOL TUG'ILSA

```bash
# 1. Indeksdan qara
grep -i "izlagan_narsang" ROADMAP/02_MALUMOTNOMA/INDEKS.md

# 2. Tez yordam
cat ROADMAP/02_MALUMOTNOMA/TEZ_YORDAM.md

# 3. TZ dan faqat kerakli qism
grep -A 45 "class Order" "TZ_MASTER/04_DATA_MODEL_VA_API.md"
```

⛔ **Hech qachon:** `cat TZ_MASTER/*.md` (260 KB, foydasiz token)

---

## 📝 HANDOFF FAYLGA NIMA YOZILADI

Har faza oxirida **halol** yoz:

- ✅ Nima qilindi (vazifa-vazifa)
- 📁 Qaysi fayllar yaratildi/o'zgartirildi
- 🤔 Qanday qarorlar qabul qilindi (TZ da yo'q bo'lsa)
- ⚠️ **Nima ishlamadi / chetlab o'tildi** ← eng muhim, yashirma
- 🧪 Testlar holati (nechta o'tdi, nechta yiqildi)
- ➡️ Keyingi fazaga eslatma

**Halol bo'l.** Bajarilmagan narsani "bajarildi" deb yozma — arxitektor AI tekshiradi va topadi.

---

## 🛠 STACK

```
Backend    Django 5 + DRF + Channels
DB         PostgreSQL (armenu_db) + pgvector
Cache/WS   Redis db=5 (cache), db=6 (channels)
Frontend   PWA — vanilla JS (framework YO'Q)
AR/3D      <model-viewer> · iOS: USDZ · Android: GLB
To'lov     paytechuz (Payme/Click/Uzum)
Test       pytest + pytest-django
Port       8060 (web), 8061 (ws)
Ish joyi   /home/user/armenu/
```

---

## ⚡ AR — 5 TA QONUN (FAZA 6)

| # | Qonun |
|---|---|
| 1 | `ar-scale="fixed"` — `auto` EMAS |
| 2 | Model **metrda** (32 sm = `0.32`) |
| 3 | Model tagi **Y=0** da |
| 4 | GLB ≤ 3 MB, USDZ ≤ 5 MB |
| 5 | Generatsiya **worker'da**, web so'rovda emas |

`verify_scale()` o'tmasa model CDN'ga chiqmaydi.

---

## 🧪 5 TA MAJBURIY TEST

Bular yiqilsa — **ishni davom ettirma**:

```bash
pytest tests/test_tenant_isolation.py       # cross-tenant sizish
pytest tests/test_i18n_completeness.py      # 3 til to'liq
pytest tests/test_order_state.py            # holat mashinasi
pytest tests/test_price_calculation.py      # narx serverda
pytest tests/test_payment_idempotency.py    # dublikat to'lov yo'q
```

